      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Yes, it's really frustrating because this is the main reason I use the website nowadays. I view like 3 world pages and then I get rate limited and can't manage favorites anymore.\n\nI think a lot of people run into this, but they might not think of reporting it, or don't know about website canny. I've just been dealing with it as a minor annoyance for months, maybe more than a year?",
